<title>JAPAN: Fuji Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.69		vs	   42.34</p>
<p> Operating	  854    million	  vs	  955    million</p>
<p> Current		1.11		vs	    1.19</p>
<p> Net		  271    million	  vs	  306    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.59 yen	  vs	    9.77 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     32 million	  vs	  32 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.40 yen	  vs	    7.40 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a Coca-Cola bottler operating west of Tokyo.</p>
</text>
